	(descr "Wurth 750316856 WE-PPTI push-pull transformer (SMD, 1408 size). Manufacturer recommended land pattern: 6 pads 1.82x1.22 mm, 2.54 mm row pitch, 13.43 mm column separation center-to-center. Pin 1 top-left; left column 1,2,3 top-to-bottom, right column 6,5,4 top-to-bottom - matches WE750316856 schematic symbol pins (1=N1.A, 2=CT_PRI, 3=N2.B, 4=N4.B, 5=CT_SEC, 6=N3.A). Body 14.75x8.3 mm max, height 4.2 mm max. Wurth datasheet 750316856 rev 004.001, 2023-02-22.")
